{"title":"Oak Stone Hearth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Carpentry Lv 20)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Carpentry at level 20 <span class=\"muted\">(275 XP)</span> from 6× <a href=\"#/item/oak-plank\">Oak Plank</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/silver-fittings\">Silver Fittings</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/carpentry\">Carpentry</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/stone-hearth\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/fd95cd05e177f637483e.svg\" alt=\"\">Stone Hearth</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-stone-hearth\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/883c6388ba3a82cd7b52.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Stone Hearth</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-stone-hearth\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/86f5a74e3b77ee87700d.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Stone Hearth</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/oak-plank\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/b1f5696977fd41e99c92.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Plank</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/1fdb314593315fdc2ce6.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Fittings</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/d3dd67a95c6277095d92.svg\" alt=\"Oak Stone Hearth\"></div><h3>Oak Stone Hearth</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Carpentry 20</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}